<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78454" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρανα-γιγνώσκω</span></b> , later <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρανα-γῑνώσκω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>read beside, compare, collate</i> one document
				<i>with</i> another, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς λόγους ἡμῶν . . π. τοῖς αὑτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					12.17
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τοὺς νόμους τῷ ψηφίσματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					3.201
				</span></i>
			 ; so 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὰς συνθήκας τάς τ᾽ ἐφ᾽ ἡμῶν
					γενομένας καὶ τὰς νῦν ἀναγεγραμμένας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					4.120
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρὰ μαρτυρίας τὰς ῥήσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.267
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				24.38
			</span></i> ; <i>read as well</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τῶν ἄλλων Στωϊκῶν βιβλία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					5.244
				</span></i>
			 :—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				172e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>read publicly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				2.12.4
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>2 Ma.</u>
				8.23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PGrenf.</u>
				2.68.16
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span> :—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ νόμου παραναγνωσθέντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>3 Ma.</u>
					1.12
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.531
			</span></i>.</div>
